Package: RintegMET
Title: Create iDMET Networks from mzTab-M Files
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Kozo", "Nishida", , "kozo.nishida@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads metabolomics results stored in the mzTab-M format and
    extracts the information needed to build iDMET networks. Files are
    parsed with 'RmzTabM'. Currently lists the study variable groups
    (experimental factors) declared in the metadata section of an mzTab-M
    file.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    RmzTabM (>= 0.99.3)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Remotes:
    RforMassSpectrometry/RmzTabM
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
